    <item>
      <title>1.2.2</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:12:59 +0800</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Codex 页可以直接用 Lazymice 账号登录或注册，填用户名就行（中文也可以），登录后自动开好 Key 并切过去。卡片右键能看使用记录。添加菜单和登录窗口换成了和主界面一样的墨色卡片。</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/lazymicezhu/Swapdeck/releases/download/v1.2.2/Swapdeck-1.2.2.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="qhY6jhItWueUAuATG0C+93wZ+PxOWWRgLUiXyR+phMEfSoXQGV4GUUZC5VcJBjrtTWK/rGXZv73C9qTvkI7zDA==" length="3369633" />
